# has neither record, so each save reported 27 PVs unconnected.
$(P)$(R)Setting
$(P)$(R)BeamEnergy
$(P)$(R)ThresholdEnergy
$(P)$(R)UseFlatField
$(P)$(R)UseCountRate
$(P)$(R)Tau
$(P)$(R)UseBadChanIntrpl
$(P)$(R)BitDepth
$(P)$(R)TriggerMode
$(P)$(R)DelayTime
$(P)$(R)UseGates
$(P)$(R)NumGates
$(P)$(R)NumFrames
$(P)$(R)ReadMode

